<% title "Sign in" %>

<p>Shared Bills tracks a household's shared bills and each housemate's balance.
Sign in with the Google account an account admin invited.</p>

<%# OmniAuth only accepts POST, and the redirect to Google must be a full page load. %>
<%= button_to "Sign in with Google", user_google_oauth2_omniauth_authorize_path,
      class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg", data: { turbo: false } %>

<p style="margin-top: 20px"><%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path %></p>
